abstract: >-
  This repository contains protocols, notebooks, model files
  and environment specifications used for automated
  processing of soil mesofauna images from BugNet field
  experiments.


  The workflow consists of three main steps:


  1. producing a standardized image dataset of soil samples

  2. Detection and extraction of individual organisms using
  a fine-tuned FlatBug model

  3. Classification and sorting of extracted crops into
  broad taxonomic groups using a YOLO-based classifier
